meta {
  name: Numbers numbersDirectoryListingPut
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2.2/numbers/:number/directory-listing
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  number: <number>
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
{
  "type": "business",
  "name": "Acme Corp",
  "streetNumber": "100",
  "streetName": "Broadway",
  "streetType": "St",
  "location": "Suite 900",
  "city": "New York",
  "state": "NY",
  "zip": "10005"
}
}

docs {
**Add or replace the directory listing**
Submits the listing. The change is accepted at once (202, status pending) and applied in the background; GET shows listed once it is published. It can take several business days to appear in directory assistance. Adding a listing requires an enabled account with a positive balance. A multi-line listing cannot be changed through the API.

OperationId: `numbersDirectoryListingPut`
}
